        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/ee7513/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-02T21:09:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, I’ve been a lurker on this board for quite some time and this seems like a great time to say hi! I’m excited to meet you all at GenCon my gaming group has been rotating Sentinels in regularly for quite a while now and I’m in love with it to the point my wife is tired of hearing about it <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\"> .&nbsp;<span>I missed the post for volunteering last year but I love meeting people and probably will talk to much, so I appologize in advance.</span></p>",
